id: list
name: List (one, two or three line items)
category: containers
summary: Rows with a leading icon or avatar, headline, supporting text and a trailing control.
requires: foundation
@@spec
- Item min height 56dp (one line), 72dp (two lines), 88dp (three lines). Padding 16dp, gap 16dp.
- Headline: Body Large. Supporting text: Body Medium on-surface-variant. Trailing meta: Label Small or Label Medium.
- Leading icon 24dp, or a 40dp circular avatar. Dividers use outline-variant, inset to align with the text.
- Interactive items (links or buttons) get state layers and a focus ring across the whole row.
@@a11y
- A real <ul>/<li>. If a row is clickable, the row is one link or button, with the headline as its name.
- Trailing controls inside a clickable row are a separate button, not nested interactive content.
- Icons are aria-hidden.
@@html
<ul class="md-list">
  <li>
    <a class="md-list__item" href="/copper">
      <span class="md-icon md-list__lead" aria-hidden="true">show_chart</span>
      <span class="md-list__text">
        <span class="md-list__headline">Copper</span>
        <span class="md-list__support">Five-year return and volatility</span>
      </span>
      <span class="md-list__trail">+51%</span>
    </a>
  </li>
  <li>
    <a class="md-list__item" href="/silver">
      <span class="md-icon md-list__lead" aria-hidden="true">show_chart</span>
      <span class="md-list__text">
        <span class="md-list__headline">Silver</span>
        <span class="md-list__support">Five-year return and volatility</span>
      </span>
      <span class="md-list__trail">+88%</span>
    </a>
  </li>
</ul>
@@css
.md-list {
  margin: 0;
  padding: var(--sp-sm) 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.md-list li + li { border-top: 0.0625rem solid var(--md-outline-variant); }

.md-list__item {
  --_bg: transparent;
  --_c: var(--md-on-surface);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-lg);
  min-height: 3.5rem;
  padding: var(--sp-sm) var(--sp-lg);
  background-color: var(--_bg);
  color: var(--_c);
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: background-color var(--md-spring-fast-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-fast-effects);
}

a.md-list__item:hover,
button.md-list__item:hover { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 8%, var(--_bg)); }
a.md-list__item:focus-visible,
button.md-list__item:focus-visible { background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--_c) 10%, var(--_bg)); }

.md-list__lead { color: var(--md-on-surface-variant); }

.md-list__text {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-width: 0;
}

.md-list__headline {
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-large-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-large-tracking);
}

.md-list__support {
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-body-medium-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-body-medium-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-body-medium-tracking);
}

.md-list__trail {
  color: var(--md-on-surface-variant);
  font-size: var(--md-type-label-medium-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-label-medium-weight);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-label-medium-tracking);
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
